  "raw_response": "```python\ndef solve(grid):\n    rows, cols = len(grid), len(grid[0])\n    from collections import defaultdict\n    \n    cells = defaultdict(list)\n    for r in range(rows):\n        for c in range(cols):\n            if grid[r][c] != 0:\n                cells[grid[r][c]].append((r, c))\n    \n    for color, coords in cells.items():\n        rs = [r for r,c in coords]\n        cs = [c for r,c in coords]\n        rmin, rmax = min(rs), max(rs)\n        cmin, cmax = min(cs), max(cs)\n        area = (rmax-rmin+1)*(cmax-cmin+1)\n        if len(coords) < area:\n            return [[color]]\n```",
